{{JPExclusive}}
'''10th and 1/2 Anniversary Birthday Cake''' is a [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] enemy that appears in [[10 and 1/2 Years of Fun!!|B-Day Gifts]]. It was added in [[Version 12.3 Update|Version 12.3]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = 10th and 1/2 Anniversary Birthday Cake
|image = E 645.png
|appearance = [[10 and 1/2 Years of Fun!!]]
|money drop = 7¢ - 27¢
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy appears to be four [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Tank Cats]] carrying a large birthday cake that stands on a can of Cat Food. At the top of the cake there is a rainbow colored ribbon. The Tank Cats can be seen under the can during its attack animation. Although it may not look like one, it is actually a Metal enemy.

==Strategy==
[[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Cow Cat]] and any other fast attacking characters such as [[Mr. (Special Cat)|Mr.]] can kill this enemy very easily. It deals pretty much no damage per hit, so there's no need to worry about it at all.

==Encounters==
